136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (During my internship at Dinkominfostasandi Kabupaten Purworejo, I was challenged to bridge the communication gap between the local government and the community through a unified public information web portal. Built with Python \(Flask\), MySQL, and Jinja2, I developed a monolithic CMS system with a responsive frontend using HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript, and Bootstrap 5.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (To make the platform more inclusive and user-friendly, I integrated the Web Speech API for Text-to-Speech accessibility, implemented Dark Mode, and developed a real-time Hoax Checker feature to help combat misinformation. From handling data integration with Newtonsoft.Json to building end-to-end system functionality, this project strengthened my skills in full-stack development, system analysis, and user-centered design.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
