/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (For my undergraduate thesis, I developed a Sentiment Analysis Dashboard to evaluate public perception of electric vehicles. I personally performed manual sentiment labeling on the YouTube dataset to ensure high-quality ground truth, then built a Hybrid Ensemble Model in Python by combining Multinomial Naive Bayes and Logistic Regression via Soft Voting)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (I engineered a specialized NLP pipeline featuring Slang Normalization, Emoji Intelligence, and Negation Handling to tackle the nuances of Indonesian social media. Using Scikit-Learn and NLTK, I implemented SMOTE for class balancing and compared TF-IDF vs CountVectorizer to optimize the model's accuracy.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
