/P 123 0 R
/E (Cafe Purworejo is a simple web platform designed to help local residents and tourists discover popular cafes in Purworejo. Developed as a front-end practice project using React and Vite, the website focuses on delivering a clean, responsive, and user-friendly browsing experience across desktop and mobile devices.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The platform features a categorized cafe directory with detailed information such as addresses, locations, and official Instagram links. I developed the application using React.js, Vite, and Tailwind CSS, while implementing responsive layouts and automatic alphabetical sorting to improve usability and navigation.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
